cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MetaEvidence in research, please cite the software release and the accompanying methodological paper when available."
title: "MetaEvidence"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-08"
authors:
  - family-names: "Galiatsatos"
    given-names: "Dimitrios"
    affiliation: "Hellenic Open University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-5232-1425"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible cross-database evidence-retrieval framework for systematic
  reviews and meta-analysis, with query translation, provenance-preserving
  deduplication, study-level publication linkage, screening interoperability,
  PRISMA-oriented reporting, and scientific benchmark infrastructure.
keywords:
  - systematic review
  - meta-analysis
  - evidence synthesis
  - literature search
  - deduplication
  - PRISMA
